 R←Test_Alias_015(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;alias;expected;qdmx
⍝ Call the API functions `RunMake`, `RunTests` and `ProjectConfig` with an alias that is not defined.
⍝ Each must throw an error naming the alias. `RunMake` and `RunTests` did not check for this at all.
⍝ The alias is a valid APL name on purpose: otherwise `GetFolderFromAlias2` complains about the name instead.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 alias←'[test_alias_015_undefined]'
 {}##.Cider.DropAlias alias~'[]'           ⍝ Just in case
 expected←'Alias "',alias,'" not found'

 :Trap 11
     {}##.Cider.RunMake alias
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/expected⍷qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 :Trap 11
     {}##.Cider.RunTests alias
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/expected⍷qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 :Trap 11
     {}##.Cider.ProjectConfig alias
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/expected⍷qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
⍝Done
